{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260614211134603c8e988a274e05","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue. The test expects that when we override only one kind with a valid model (\"openai/gpt-4o\"), the other 6 kinds that use the default \"pi-lhc/unconfigured\" should be reported as unreachable.\n\nBut looking at `createMockContext`, when `availableModels` is provided with `[{ provider: \"openai\", id: \"gpt-4o\" }]`, the registry's `find` function looks for models in that array. The default \"pi-lhc/unconfigured\" is NOT in that array, so it should be reported as unreachable.\n\nWait, let me re-read the `createMockContext` function:\n\n```typescript\nfunction createMockContext(\n  availableModels: ModelHandle[] = [],\n  findResult?: ModelHandle | undefined,\n  hasAuthResult: boolean = true,\n): ExtensionContext {\n  const models = availableModels.length > 0\n    ? availableModels\n    : [{ provider: \"pi-lhc\", id: \"unconfigured\" }];\n\n  return {\n    ...\n    modelRegistry: {\n      find: findResult !== undefined\n        ? (() => findResult)\n        : ((provider: string, model: string) =>\n            models.find((m) => m.provider === provider && m.id === model)),\n      ...\n    },\n  };\n}\n```\n\nSo when `availableModels = [{ provider: \"openai\", id: \"gpt-4o\" }]`, the `models` variable is set to that array. Then `find` looks for a model in that array. Since \"pi-lhc/unconfigured\" is NOT in `[{ provider: \"openai\", id: \"gpt-4o\" }]`, it should return `undefined`, which means the lane is unreachable.\n\nOh wait, I see the issue now. \n\nThe problem is that the test is passing `models[0]` as the `findResult` parameter, which means the `find` function always returns that `openai/gpt-4o` model regardless of what we're looking for. This means every provider/model combination will resolve to that single model, so all 7 kinds appear reachable.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a10094db-b1fb-4175-b007-bb5af83ee62f","uuid":"e6782296-968c-4b61-8b87-58a338934372"}
